# Build context of every image is the repository root (infra/docker/app.Dockerfile).
# Environment files never enter the context: configuration reaches a container
# at run time - the root `.env` mounted read-only at /repo/.env plus Compose's
# `environment` - not through a layer.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Tests of the packages and their configs stay out of every image: no runtime
# imports them (docs/DECISIONS.md, 20.10.2026), and a change to a test does
# not invalidate the `COPY . .` layer. packages/config/vitest/ is not masked
# and stays in the images: it is an export of @sf/config (`./vitest/setup`),
# so it ships with the package, and it throws when imported outside a vitest
# run. The list is not widened to it (decision R1 of E0-12J).
**/test
**/test-support
**/*.test.ts
**/vitest*.config.*

# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Repository tooling, case files, local data and documents.
.git
.github
.claude
.claude-snapshots
tasks
data
docs
